ir marriage remains unclear, but insiders claim that the couple has been together for decades, with Lady Townshend frequently traveling back in time to be with her beloved.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"I've known Lady Townshend for years, and I had no idea she was leading this double life,\\\" said Lady Victoria Windsor, a close friend of the family.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"\\\"She's always been a bit of an enigma, but this is just incredible.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"I'm still trying to wrap my head around it.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Lady Townshend's husband, Rebecca Woodward, was a prominent figure in 19th-century British society, known for her beauty, wit, and philanthropic work.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Her untimely death at the age of 25 sent shockwaves through the aristocracy, and her legacy has endured to this day.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"\\\"I've always felt a deep connection to Rebecca,\\\" Lady Townshend said in an exclusive interview.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"\\\"I know it sounds impossible, but our love transcends time and space.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"We've been together for so long, and I couldn't imagine living without her.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"While the exact details of their marriage remain unclear, experts have been quick to weigh in on the phenomenon.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"Sophia Patel, a leading physicist, suggests that Lady Townshend may be experiencing a rare case of quantum entanglement, where two particles become connected across vast distances.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"\\\"It's a fascinating concept, and one that challenges our understanding of time and space,\\\" Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"Patel explained.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"\\\"While it's impossible to say for certain, it's possible that Lady Townshend has found a way to bridge the gap between her reality and Rebec